### Get CSRF Token
# @name getCSRF
HEAD https://go.support.sap.com/minisap/odata/bkey/minisap/
X-CSRF-Token: Fetch
### Read Token to Variable
@csrf={{getCSRF.response.headers.x-csrf-token}}
###
POST https://go.support.sap.com/minisap/odata/bkey/minisap/LicenseKey
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Accept: application/json

{
  "Type":"{{$dotenv Type}}",
  "Name":"{{$dotenv Name}}",
  "Email":"{{$dotenv Email}}",
  "Hwkey":"{{$dotenv Hwkey}}",
  "HostID":"",
  "HostName":""
}